# NON-secret config — committed plaintext, Arcane's git layer (docs/conventions/compose.md).
#
# This service's ONLY secret is the tunnel credential, and it is a FILE, not a dotenv value —
# it lives sops-encrypted at credentials.json.sops and is bind-mounted (see compose.yaml).
# So there is no .env.sops here; the effective .env is just this file.

# Metrics/readiness server. `cloudflared tunnel run` exposes /ready here, and the healthcheck
# (`cloudflared tunnel ready`) reads this same TUNNEL_METRICS to probe it. In-container only.
TUNNEL_METRICS=0.0.0.0:2000
